Subject: [PATCH v3 1/9] backlight: atmel-pwm-bl: fix reported brightness
Date: Thu, 31 Oct 2013 18:57:36 +0100
Message-Id: <1383242264-7652-2-git-send-email-jhovold@gmail.com>
